WEBVTT

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:06.650
Akatsuki Kojou...

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:10.520
Forget what you saw back there. Understood?

00:00:12.140 --> 00:00:13.540
S-Sure.

00:00:13.910 --> 00:00:18.660
I'm, uh... glad you found your 
bikini top after it floated off...

00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:23.870
I told you to forget it, 
you pervert Progenitor!

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:28.630
Is this the time 
for fooling around, you two?

00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:30.320
H-Himeragi...

00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:34.850
Don't misunderstand, Yukina! 
The Fourth Sex Offender here was—

00:00:34.850 --> 00:00:37.330
Also, I wasn't fooling around!

00:00:37.330 --> 00:00:38.640
Kirasaka's the one who—

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:45.920
I'm sorry.

00:00:44.340 --> 00:00:45.940
S-Sorry.

00:00:46.420 --> 00:00:48.340
Fine, then.

00:00:53.040 --> 00:00:55.910
There it is. The magical beast park.

00:00:55.910 --> 00:00:58.240
We can get a boat there, right?

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:08.150
<i>Just wait, Yume.</i>

00:01:08.150 --> 00:01:10.960
<i>I'm not gonna let them sacrifice you!</i>

00:02:41.770 --> 00:02:45.600
Damn it! This laptop just 
doesn't have enough power!

00:02:45.930 --> 00:02:47.680
Mogwai, how's it going on your end?

00:02:47.890 --> 00:02:51.450
<i>I found their control program, LYL.</i>

00:02:51.650 --> 00:02:55.260
<i>Still... you say this thing 
is Eguchi Yume's alter ego?</i>

00:02:55.260 --> 00:02:58.550
<i>It's basically all hatred toward 
mankind rolled into a ball.</i>

00:02:59.760 --> 00:03:01.100
So that's it.

00:03:01.390 --> 00:03:04.740
The succubus Lilith's soul has been 
passed down for generations.

00:03:05.330 --> 00:03:08.560
They've electronically extracted 
and concentrated the negative emotions

00:03:08.560 --> 00:03:10.990
that it's accumulated with each generation.

00:03:10.990 --> 00:03:14.480
<i>Haha! You are correct, Empress!</i>

00:03:14.480 --> 00:03:16.650
<i>Is Mogwai-dono also doing well?</i>

00:03:16.650 --> 00:03:20.330
That ridiculous tone... Lydianne Didier?

00:03:20.520 --> 00:03:23.050
Why am I hearing your voice, Tank?!

00:03:23.690 --> 00:03:26.680
I have been entrusted by the Taishi Bureau

00:03:26.680 --> 00:03:29.940
with the management of the LYL system.

00:03:29.940 --> 00:03:31.410
The Taishi Bureau?

00:03:31.410 --> 00:03:34.810
Isn't that a government agency 
for preventing magic disasters?

00:03:34.810 --> 00:03:38.210
What are they planning to do 
with a ridiculous system like that?

00:03:39.290 --> 00:03:42.900
You are better off not 
knowing the answer to that.

00:03:42.900 --> 00:03:45.260
Well, enough talk.

00:03:45.260 --> 00:03:47.910
Time to fight, fair and square!

00:03:48.820 --> 00:03:49.380
Wha—

00:03:49.570 --> 00:03:51.840
Wait just a minute, Tank!

00:03:51.840 --> 00:03:53.480
Damn it!

00:04:01.360 --> 00:04:03.180
So this is Leviathan...

00:04:03.180 --> 00:04:06.960
It is truly the greatest of all 
the beasts created by the gods!

00:04:06.960 --> 00:04:09.420
So fierce, and so beautiful!

00:04:30.490 --> 00:04:32.150
At last, we're here!

00:04:32.420 --> 00:04:34.880
<i>Docking complete.</i>

00:04:34.880 --> 00:04:37.190
<i>Starting up LYL.</i>

00:04:38.940 --> 00:04:41.720
The module started up on its own?

00:04:42.920 --> 00:04:45.830
Attack Mage Kisaki, what is going on?!

00:04:46.900 --> 00:04:48.850
Lilith has awakened!

00:04:48.850 --> 00:04:52.320
<i>All is as we anticipated, Chairman Kusuki.</i>

00:04:52.590 --> 00:04:56.270
<i>Riru, you know what you must do now, yes?</i>

00:04:57.100 --> 00:05:00.650
Of course, Kiriha. I just need to destroy...

00:05:00.980 --> 00:05:03.530
that stupid Itogami Island, right?

00:05:03.720 --> 00:05:04.490
Fool!

00:05:04.700 --> 00:05:06.400
<i>This isn't what we agreed upon!</i>

00:05:06.580 --> 00:05:09.870
For certain reasons, I'm making use of

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:13.950
your terrorist plan involving Leviathan.

00:05:14.060 --> 00:05:17.930
<i>You've been deceiving me 
all along, you vixen?!</i>

00:05:20.270 --> 00:05:22.260
So how does it feel,

00:05:22.260 --> 00:05:24.990
knowing that you're the one 
who's gonna be sacrificed?

00:05:25.750 --> 00:05:27.920
Oh, gosh! What's that look on your face?

00:05:27.920 --> 00:05:29.520
You gonna cry, old man?

00:05:30.230 --> 00:05:31.320
You little—

00:05:33.080 --> 00:05:37.650
Thank you, too, Kiriha, 
for fulfilling Yume's dream.

00:05:37.650 --> 00:05:42.900
I loved how you always acted so calm, 
despite your conscience eating away at you.

00:05:45.300 --> 00:05:47.230
Goodbye, Riru.

00:05:47.740 --> 00:05:50.190
<i>And have pleasant dreams, Chairman.</i>

00:05:55.630 --> 00:05:56.640
Is that it?

00:05:56.760 --> 00:05:57.780
This way!

00:06:01.830 --> 00:06:04.550
Where do you intend on 
going after stealing that boat,

00:06:04.550 --> 00:06:05.760
Fourth Progenitor?

00:06:05.910 --> 00:06:06.860
Kisaki!

00:06:06.860 --> 00:06:08.670
You think you're going to stop us?!

00:06:08.990 --> 00:06:12.910
If you intend to go to Leviathan, 
I'll stop you by force if I must.

00:06:13.250 --> 00:06:14.190
But...

00:06:14.870 --> 00:06:18.040
Personally, I recommend that you evacuate.

00:06:19.490 --> 00:06:20.690
What do you mean?

00:06:21.060 --> 00:06:26.320
In mere moments, this island is 
going to be destroyed by Leviathan.

00:06:27.500 --> 00:06:31.280
Hang on. This is where 
Kusuki Elysee's lab is,

00:06:31.280 --> 00:06:34.230
and that's where they're 
controlling Leviathan, right?

00:06:34.230 --> 00:06:37.170
So why would Kusuki want to destroy it?

00:06:37.170 --> 00:06:41.240
The one controlling Leviathan 
is not Chairman Kusuki.

00:06:41.240 --> 00:06:42.380
It's Riru.

00:06:42.380 --> 00:06:45.990
Huh? That makes even less sense!

00:06:45.990 --> 00:06:48.560
Isn't LYL the control system?

00:06:48.820 --> 00:06:52.260
Why would it want to destroy itself?

00:06:52.260 --> 00:06:54.170
That is what Riru wants.

00:06:54.280 --> 00:06:55.160
Huh?

00:06:55.880 --> 00:07:00.420
To wipe it from the face of the earth, 
leaving not a single trace.

00:07:00.680 --> 00:07:05.360
That is Riru's... no, Eguchi Yume's wish.

00:07:06.030 --> 00:07:09.700
Because she awoke 
as the world's most powerful succubus,

00:07:09.700 --> 00:07:12.750
she has suffered so 
many painful experiences.

00:07:14.240 --> 00:07:17.900
For example, all of her 
classmates and her parents

00:07:17.900 --> 00:07:21.140
are still trapped in a deep sleep,

00:07:21.660 --> 00:07:23.810
because Eguchi Yume let her succubus powers

00:07:23.810 --> 00:07:27.330
rage out of control, in an effort 
to protect herself from abuse.

00:07:29.040 --> 00:07:32.120
She likely blames herself 
quite harshly for that.

00:07:32.120 --> 00:07:34.320
She probably even wished she could die.

00:07:34.590 --> 00:07:37.120
But she couldn't.

00:07:37.120 --> 00:07:38.490
Do you know why?

00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:42.740
You don't mean... 
because Yume-chan is Lilith?

00:07:43.030 --> 00:07:44.400
Correct.

00:07:44.400 --> 00:07:46.070
If she were to die,

00:07:46.070 --> 00:07:50.760
Lilith's powers would be passed along to another 
qualified individual, who could be anywhere,

00:07:50.760 --> 00:07:52.940
and the same tragedy will be repeated.

00:07:53.860 --> 00:07:57.830
But if she dies within Leviathan, 
the story will change.

00:07:58.010 --> 00:08:01.500
Inside it, Lilith's soul 
will be unable to escape.

00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:03.790
It will eventually be 
absorbed and disappear.

00:08:03.910 --> 00:08:08.320
So Yume went into that thing 
because she planned to die all along?

00:08:08.510 --> 00:08:12.740
At first, Eguchi Yume herself 
probably wasn't aware of this.

00:08:13.050 --> 00:08:16.360
That's why she escaped with Kirasaka Sayaka.

00:08:16.660 --> 00:08:20.720
But Riru knew what the girl truly wanted.

00:08:20.850 --> 00:08:23.810
That is why she cooperated 
with Kusuki Elysee.

00:08:24.400 --> 00:08:25.570
Yume...

00:08:25.960 --> 00:08:29.930
Damn it! There's no way 
we'll let her do that!

00:08:30.140 --> 00:08:32.910
You really think you can stop Leviathan?

00:08:32.910 --> 00:08:36.040
It's a biological weapon 
from the age of the gods.

00:08:37.360 --> 00:08:40.220
And I'm the strongest vampire in the world.

00:08:40.420 --> 00:08:44.620
If I can't make myself useful now, 
I'd just be a laughingstock!

00:08:44.620 --> 00:08:48.170
Then it seems I have no 
choice but to do this.

00:08:48.660 --> 00:08:51.920
You two get out of here! I'll stall her!

00:08:52.480 --> 00:08:55.890
Take care of Eguchi Yume. 
You have to save her.

00:08:56.760 --> 00:08:57.960
Understood.

00:08:57.960 --> 00:08:59.600
Let's go, Senpai.

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:00.900
She's all yours, Kirasaka!

00:09:05.590 --> 00:09:08.940
I won't hold back this time, War Dancer.

00:09:09.140 --> 00:09:13.190
Saying things like that will make 
your defeat even more humiliating,

00:09:13.190 --> 00:09:14.410
Six-Blade Priestess!

00:09:24.260 --> 00:09:26.290
Senpai, look!

00:09:27.510 --> 00:09:30.300
An island? Was that always there?

00:09:30.300 --> 00:09:33.090
No, I think that's Leviathan.

00:09:33.090 --> 00:09:36.420
Are you serious?! It's way too huge!

00:09:36.880 --> 00:09:40.120
Yume and the rest 
are in there, right, Mogwai?

00:09:40.120 --> 00:09:42.560
<i>If they haven't been digested yet, yeah.</i>

00:09:42.850 --> 00:09:44.360
Don't even joke about that!

00:09:44.790 --> 00:09:48.540
Please get the boat as close 
to Yume-chan as possible, Mogwai-san!

00:09:48.760 --> 00:09:50.720
<i>You make it sound so easy.</i>

00:09:50.720 --> 00:09:52.970
<i>I mean, I'll give it a try, though.</i>

00:09:58.430 --> 00:10:00.620
<i>Whoops. It's noticed us.</i>

00:10:04.210 --> 00:10:06.850
Wait a minute! Is that...

00:10:08.290 --> 00:10:08.970
Himeragi!

00:10:10.090 --> 00:10:11.420
Schneesturm Wolfin!

00:10:27.750 --> 00:10:29.510
Himeragi! You okay?!

00:10:29.510 --> 00:10:31.440
Yes, somehow.

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:36.130
I think it just concentrated all its 
magical power and fired it as a beam.

00:10:36.440 --> 00:10:38.420
Its power was incredible...

00:10:40.970 --> 00:10:43.540
Damn! Like hell I'll let you do that again!

00:10:43.990 --> 00:10:46.500
Come, Regulus Aurum!

00:10:59.870 --> 00:11:01.360
It didn't work?

00:11:01.540 --> 00:11:03.450
It blocked the blow with a magic barrier!

00:11:04.860 --> 00:11:07.870
We can't do anything 
about this guy from outside.

00:11:07.870 --> 00:11:12.250
We'll have to go inside it 
to get Yume-chan out, anyway.

00:11:13.830 --> 00:11:16.290
I know it's kinda late to say this now,

00:11:16.290 --> 00:11:18.400
but this is gonna be insanely dangerous.

00:11:19.480 --> 00:11:21.860
It really is a bit late to say that.

00:11:21.860 --> 00:11:25.660
I'm the observer for the world's 
strongest vampire, you know.

00:11:28.060 --> 00:11:29.910
Mogwai, take us in!

00:11:30.080 --> 00:11:32.240
<i>Sheesh, talk about reckless.</i>

00:11:32.240 --> 00:11:34.140
<i>Don't blame me for whatever happens.</i>

00:11:38.460 --> 00:11:42.200
I, Sword Shaman of the High God, 
as a priestess of the Lion, beseech thee...

00:11:44.190 --> 00:11:46.980
Dawn light of exorcism, 
spirit wolf of snowy mist...

00:11:47.450 --> 00:11:49.110
Grant me the divine might of thy steel,

00:11:50.570 --> 00:11:53.120
that I may smite a hundred evil spirits!

00:11:59.350 --> 00:12:02.950
Come, Al-Maisan Mercury!

00:12:06.590 --> 00:12:09.290
Go!

00:12:20.490 --> 00:12:21.660
How are Kojou and the girls?

00:12:21.660 --> 00:12:23.310
<i>Alive, somehow or other.</i>

00:12:23.310 --> 00:12:24.720
<i>More importantly, little miss,</i>

00:12:24.720 --> 00:12:27.340
<i>our relay server's 
firewall has been breached.</i>

00:12:27.550 --> 00:12:29.010
How many proxies do we have?

00:12:29.010 --> 00:12:30.800
<i>There are 12,000 left.</i>

00:12:30.800 --> 00:12:34.590
<i>Our attacks aren't nearly fast enough.</i>

00:12:34.920 --> 00:12:37.520
I guess we should've 
expected that from Tank.

00:12:37.640 --> 00:12:41.840
<i>Are you ready to give up now, Empress?</i>

00:12:41.840 --> 00:12:42.710
What?

00:12:42.710 --> 00:12:45.280
You think I'd throw a fight 
that I know I can win?

00:12:45.280 --> 00:12:48.480
How amusing to see such bravado 
in the midst of all this.

00:12:48.720 --> 00:12:53.530
I would wager you are the type 
to let your pride get in the way

00:12:53.530 --> 00:12:56.460
of saying what you truly feel, 
despite your inexperience with men.

00:12:56.640 --> 00:13:00.170
As if a kid in elementary 
school would have a clue!

00:13:00.170 --> 00:13:03.910
Mogwai, go ahead and use all 
of our remaining proxies as decoys!

00:13:03.910 --> 00:13:05.500
Just hold out for 90 seconds!

00:13:06.350 --> 00:13:09.200
<i>You're finally starting 
to sound like yourself, little miss.</i>

00:13:09.680 --> 00:13:12.900
Bolstering your defenses 
will do you no good now.

00:13:12.900 --> 00:13:15.210
I will soon surround you and crush your—

00:13:15.210 --> 00:13:16.350
What?!

00:13:16.350 --> 00:13:19.600
Th-This attack... 
It's coming from Neustria?!

00:13:20.030 --> 00:13:24.120
You're the pride and joy of Didier 
Heavy Industries, a real prodigy, yes?

00:13:24.420 --> 00:13:28.070
<i>Isn't that robotic tank 
a Didier prototype, too?</i>

00:13:28.070 --> 00:13:30.830
Didier

00:13:28.520 --> 00:13:31.900
Don't tell me... You hijacked 
Didier Heavy Industries' computer

00:13:31.900 --> 00:13:34.050
and used it as a stepping stone?

00:13:34.050 --> 00:13:36.460
This is a company 
that makes military equipment!

00:13:36.730 --> 00:13:40.090
It was easier than targeting 
the Kusuki Elysee server

00:13:40.090 --> 00:13:42.040
that you've got so tightly guarded.

00:13:42.160 --> 00:13:45.670
<i>Now I can just stroll into 
the LYL system through the front door.</i>

00:13:45.670 --> 00:13:47.280
<i>Don't hold this against me, okay?</i>

00:13:49.600 --> 00:13:52.190
You defeated me so easily...

00:13:52.450 --> 00:13:55.490
Empress, you truly are...

00:13:55.710 --> 00:13:56.990
...the Priestess of Cain?!

00:13:58.400 --> 00:13:59.650
It's Aiba-san?!

00:13:59.920 --> 00:14:03.850
You didn't know the true identity 
of your rival in love, War Dancer?

00:14:03.990 --> 00:14:05.420
That can't be...

00:14:06.400 --> 00:14:08.870
Wait, who said she was my rival in love?!

00:14:08.870 --> 00:14:13.240
The Priestess of Cain will one 
day be the trigger in a holy war.

00:14:13.520 --> 00:14:16.610
The Taishi Bureau believed 
that would be too dangerous.

00:14:16.900 --> 00:14:20.660
So you decided to use Leviathan 
to destroy Itogami Island with her on it?

00:14:20.660 --> 00:14:24.450
That's insane! Who would go 
so far to kill one person?!

00:14:25.040 --> 00:14:27.200
It's because Aiba Asagi 
cannot be killed by anyone

00:14:27.200 --> 00:14:29.920
so long as she remains on Itogami Island.

00:14:30.040 --> 00:14:34.640
Not even by the Fourth Progenitor 
using a Schneewalzer.

00:14:35.290 --> 00:14:39.020
This island's creation 
violated the rules of nature.

00:14:39.020 --> 00:14:41.320
So for Cain, who has been 
cursed by the earth itself,

00:14:41.320 --> 00:14:43.640
it serves as an enormous altar.

00:14:43.740 --> 00:14:46.070
This island in its entirety is her ally.

00:14:46.640 --> 00:14:49.400
Every unexplained coincidence 
that happens here protects her.

00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:51.650
That can't be possible!

00:14:51.650 --> 00:14:56.220
That is why the Taishi Bureau came up 
with a plan to use Leviathan.

00:14:56.570 --> 00:15:00.320
Then I'm sorry to tell you this, 
but your plan failed.

00:15:00.910 --> 00:15:01.760
Why do you say so?

00:15:01.970 --> 00:15:05.250
Because Akatsuki Kojou 
and Yukina are going to stop Leviathan

00:15:05.250 --> 00:15:07.010
and bring Eguchi Yume back!

00:15:07.380 --> 00:15:09.600
And I won't let you get in their way!

00:15:10.100 --> 00:15:13.050
You speak so confidently about 
a task you aren't even capable of.

00:15:13.370 --> 00:15:14.530
I will kill you!

00:15:19.730 --> 00:15:20.830
Mercurius! Saikei!

00:15:22.200 --> 00:15:24.860
That speed... A physical enchantment?

00:15:24.860 --> 00:15:26.280
How can you use such a powerful—

00:15:26.540 --> 00:15:30.960
War Dancers of the Lion King Organization 
specialize in hexes and assassination.

00:15:30.960 --> 00:15:35.130
Of course we also know very 
well how to hex ourselves!

00:15:35.250 --> 00:15:36.420
Insolent brat!

00:15:40.130 --> 00:15:41.290
Saturnus! Saiha!

00:15:46.630 --> 00:15:48.720
The Eight General-Gods Arts...

00:15:48.720 --> 00:15:51.090
The Lion King Organization's 
assassination art?

00:15:52.210 --> 00:15:55.550
It would seem my failure 
lay in underestimating you,

00:15:55.890 --> 00:15:57.350
Kirasaka Sayaka.

00:15:57.840 --> 00:16:00.450
I enjoyed this opportunity to fight you.

00:16:00.970 --> 00:16:04.670
Thank you for... stopping me...

00:16:07.130 --> 00:16:09.040
What're you thanking me for?

00:16:09.040 --> 00:16:10.150
Talk about selfish.

00:16:11.130 --> 00:16:15.290
<i>I'm putting my faith in you, Akatsuki Kojou.</i>

00:16:15.290 --> 00:16:17.130
<i>You'd better take care of all this.</i>

00:16:24.560 --> 00:16:26.660
Leviathan stopped?

00:16:26.660 --> 00:16:30.300
Aiba-senpai must have stopped LYL's program.

00:16:30.300 --> 00:16:32.080
Yeah. Now's our chance!

00:16:35.000 --> 00:16:36.000
Is that it?

00:16:36.000 --> 00:16:37.270
I think so.

00:16:42.270 --> 00:16:43.480
Senpai!

00:16:43.480 --> 00:16:44.600
I'm fine!

00:16:45.110 --> 00:16:49.440
You followed me all the way here? 
You don't know when to quit, do you?

00:16:50.060 --> 00:16:54.320
Dying inside this monster 
is what Yume wants.

00:16:54.810 --> 00:16:57.520
You're planning to drag 
her out against her will?

00:16:57.820 --> 00:17:00.020
Yeah, that's right.

00:17:00.020 --> 00:17:02.000
You should mind your own business.

00:17:02.370 --> 00:17:05.770
I bet you both just wanted to 
help a poor, little kid

00:17:05.770 --> 00:17:08.390
so you could pat yourselves 
on the back, didn't you?

00:17:08.520 --> 00:17:12.080
Or is it because you wanted to 
do nasty things with Yume?

00:17:12.080 --> 00:17:13.500
Ew, gross!

00:17:13.500 --> 00:17:15.900
Kojou-san the pe-do-phi-le!

00:17:18.200 --> 00:17:19.910
Who're you calling a pedophile?

00:17:19.910 --> 00:17:22.080
Don't just go around assigning 
people weird fetishes.

00:17:22.080 --> 00:17:24.020
I have no interest in little girls' bodies!

00:17:25.230 --> 00:17:27.800
I-I don't have a little girl's body!

00:17:27.800 --> 00:17:29.430
I'm at least a little bit—

00:17:30.170 --> 00:17:34.240
I figured as much. 
You're a lousy actor, you know.

00:17:34.240 --> 00:17:35.950
Come on, we're leaving, Yume.

00:17:36.080 --> 00:17:38.130
I-I'm not acting!

00:17:38.130 --> 00:17:41.420
Riru wouldn't call me "Kojou-san."

00:17:45.270 --> 00:17:47.750
Why... do you care?

00:17:48.620 --> 00:17:51.350
You only just met me...

00:17:52.010 --> 00:17:54.900
yet you came to a place 
like this to bring be back?

00:17:56.000 --> 00:17:58.760
There's no guarantee you 
can get out of here alive!

00:17:59.280 --> 00:18:01.110
You may be right.

00:18:01.380 --> 00:18:06.130
I might just be a hypocrite 
doing this for self-satisfaction.

00:18:06.590 --> 00:18:09.510
But still, I'm gonna save you.

00:18:09.700 --> 00:18:10.730
Why?!

00:18:10.960 --> 00:18:12.720
Because...

00:18:12.720 --> 00:18:16.460
you've never felt so happy 
that you could die without regrets!

00:18:17.210 --> 00:18:18.710
We're leaving, Yume.

00:18:18.710 --> 00:18:22.910
I don't care if you're the world's 
strongest succubus, or Lilith, or whoever.

00:18:22.910 --> 00:18:26.290
You're gonna live a life so happy, 
you'll die without regrets.

00:18:26.590 --> 00:18:30.920
And if anyone gets in your way, 
I'll kick their asses!

00:18:31.130 --> 00:18:33.300
You're not alone anymore.

00:18:35.190 --> 00:18:38.300
From now on, this is my fight.

00:18:38.590 --> 00:18:40.800
Kojou-san...

00:18:41.960 --> 00:18:43.020
No, Senpai.

00:18:43.450 --> 00:18:45.430
This is our fight.

00:18:47.360 --> 00:18:50.450
So come back with us, Yume-chan.

00:18:51.870 --> 00:18:53.680
Yukina-oneesan...

00:19:05.240 --> 00:19:06.090
Yume!

00:19:06.540 --> 00:19:07.780
What's going on?!

00:19:07.780 --> 00:19:09.910
Leviathan restarted on its own?!

00:19:10.060 --> 00:19:13.790
<i>Heh, that's the world's most 
powerful biological weapon for ya.</i>

00:19:13.790 --> 00:19:17.120
<i>It escaped Lilith's mind control on its own.</i>

00:19:17.280 --> 00:19:22.640
<i>Right now, it's probably mad as hell 
at the people who were controlling it.</i>

00:19:27.480 --> 00:19:28.800
Koukarin!

00:19:35.810 --> 00:19:37.070
I can't block them all!

00:19:40.080 --> 00:19:41.280
Who are—

00:19:41.990 --> 00:19:44.810
I am known as Tank.

00:19:44.810 --> 00:19:48.410
I am a friend of the Empress, Aiba Asagi.

00:19:50.640 --> 00:19:53.840
Damn... We have to stop Leviathan somehow!

00:19:54.240 --> 00:19:56.130
Will you help me, Himeragi?

00:19:56.130 --> 00:19:58.760
Yes. If there's anything I can do, I'll do it.

00:19:59.240 --> 00:20:00.730
Then, strip!

00:20:02.110 --> 00:20:03.120
Huh?!

00:20:05.700 --> 00:20:08.020
I-I'm sorry! It was a reflex!

00:20:08.020 --> 00:20:10.500
But when you make jokes like that...

00:20:10.500 --> 00:20:13.760
It wasn't a joke! 
I was asking to suck your blood!

00:20:13.760 --> 00:20:17.030
I don't think I've taken enough 
yet to wake it up!

00:20:17.310 --> 00:20:18.560
"It"?

00:20:18.560 --> 00:20:20.980
Oh, a new Familiar?

00:20:21.660 --> 00:20:23.730
But... I don't want to...

00:20:23.730 --> 00:20:24.540
What?!

00:20:24.540 --> 00:20:29.450
Even seeing me in a swimsuit 
wouldn't make you happy.

00:20:29.450 --> 00:20:32.360
You said to just forget about it.

00:20:32.360 --> 00:20:34.400
Um... I said that?

00:20:36.780 --> 00:20:38.670
No choice, then.

00:20:38.670 --> 00:20:42.960
I'll just have to do something 
with the Familiars I have now.

00:20:43.080 --> 00:20:44.340
Senpai!

00:20:45.250 --> 00:20:46.580
This wound...

00:20:46.580 --> 00:20:47.880
It's no big deal.

00:20:49.510 --> 00:20:52.270
Did this happen when 
Yume-chan attacked earlier?

00:20:52.700 --> 00:20:54.530
Don't tell Yume.

00:20:56.320 --> 00:20:58.540
Honestly, Senpai...

00:20:58.540 --> 00:21:00.930
What am I going to do with you?

00:21:07.400 --> 00:21:10.770
Okay, Senpai. You can look at me.

00:21:14.540 --> 00:21:16.600
I just bought it...

00:21:16.600 --> 00:21:19.600
so you're the only one who's seen it.

00:21:20.280 --> 00:21:22.840
Does it... look weird?

00:21:23.100 --> 00:21:26.060
No... I think it's cute. It suits you.

00:21:27.180 --> 00:21:31.420
That's the first time I've ever heard 
you compliment someone's swimsuit.

00:21:31.420 --> 00:21:32.760
Now that you mention it...

00:21:33.090 --> 00:21:35.280
You might be the only one 
I've ever said that to.

00:21:35.600 --> 00:21:40.240
The... only one? Really?

00:21:41.600 --> 00:21:42.760
Himeragi...

00:22:00.830 --> 00:22:04.020
I see. So you're next.

00:22:13.500 --> 00:22:15.640
Depending on how you look at it,

00:22:15.640 --> 00:22:18.980
you might've been 
the biggest victim in all this.

00:22:19.710 --> 00:22:22.970
If you wanna hold it against someone, 
make it me, Leviathan!

00:22:23.430 --> 00:22:29.270
I, Akatsuki Kojou, 
successor to the blood of Kaleid Blood,

00:22:29.270 --> 00:22:31.760
now release your constraints.

00:22:31.890 --> 00:22:34.930
Come, seventh Familiar,

00:22:34.930 --> 00:22:36.630
Kiffa Ater!

00:22:42.480 --> 00:22:44.320
An intelligent weapon?!

00:22:44.670 --> 00:22:47.110
The Sword of Judgment...

00:22:50.780 --> 00:22:53.260
Gonna be hard to run away 
with that massive body!

00:22:53.260 --> 00:22:55.520
Sorry, Leviathan!

00:23:10.460 --> 00:23:12.280
You went too far, Senpai!

00:23:12.280 --> 00:23:14.550
Are you trying to sink Blue Elysium itself?!

00:23:14.550 --> 00:23:16.630
Wh-What choice did I have?!

00:23:16.630 --> 00:23:19.000
That thing didn't exactly give me 
an option to go easy on it!

00:23:22.090 --> 00:23:24.750
Damn! It still wants to fight?

00:23:30.160 --> 00:23:31.390
Yume-chan!

00:23:31.390 --> 00:23:32.640
Stop, Yume!

00:23:33.520 --> 00:23:37.310
Your mind control won't work 
on that thing anymore!

00:23:47.340 --> 00:23:48.710
This is...

00:23:50.040 --> 00:23:52.690
She's actually... persuading it?

00:23:54.010 --> 00:23:56.760
A biological weapon 
from the age of the gods?

00:24:10.560 --> 00:24:13.130
And Lilith's supposed to 
be the Witch of Night?

00:24:14.160 --> 00:24:17.400
More like a goddess of light.

00:25:59.000 --> 00:26:02.260
The Fourth Progenitor saved them this time.

00:26:02.650 --> 00:26:04.960
You've got some nerve saying that.

00:26:05.280 --> 00:26:08.590
You're the one who got 
them involved in this.

00:26:08.590 --> 00:26:12.190
And now the Taishi Bureau 
is in tremendous debt to him.

00:26:12.550 --> 00:26:16.430
No one will be targeting 
the Priestess of Cain for a while.

00:26:16.620 --> 00:26:18.690
I sure hope so.

00:26:19.120 --> 00:26:23.890
It doesn't make me feel too good when my 
dear students' lives are being targeted.

00:26:24.180 --> 00:26:26.800
There you are, Kojou-kun!

00:26:26.800 --> 00:26:29.750
Where have you been? 
It's been crazy around here!

00:26:30.020 --> 00:26:30.640
Huh?

00:26:30.640 --> 00:26:32.760
Kojou, help!

00:26:33.230 --> 00:26:35.350
Asagi? What happened?

00:26:35.660 --> 00:26:38.350
Ah, Akatsuki-kun! Perfect timing!

00:26:38.350 --> 00:26:40.360
Ch-Chief?!

00:26:40.570 --> 00:26:44.040
Time to get back to work, part-timer.

00:26:44.130 --> 00:26:46.160
Work? Right now?!

00:26:46.620 --> 00:26:49.010
Nothing I can do about this one.

00:26:49.010 --> 00:26:52.650
It's all coming out of your paycheck.

00:26:52.650 --> 00:26:54.480
Wait!

00:26:54.640 --> 00:26:56.830
He can't work right now.

00:26:56.830 --> 00:26:59.920
Kojou-san is going to play with me!

00:26:59.920 --> 00:27:01.460
You promised, remember?

00:27:01.460 --> 00:27:02.420
I did?

00:27:02.520 --> 00:27:03.540
Yes!

00:27:03.540 --> 00:27:06.390
You said you'd make me happy 
for the rest of my life!

00:27:06.530 --> 00:27:07.120
Wha?

00:27:07.210 --> 00:27:08.320
Kojou-kun...

00:27:08.490 --> 00:27:14.250
You did say something that 
could've been perceived that way.

00:27:14.250 --> 00:27:16.230
Akatsuki Kojou...

00:27:16.930 --> 00:27:20.260
Kojou, did you seriously...

00:27:20.470 --> 00:27:22.510
Gimme a break!
